	(text "Star Tracker"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 92.456 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "af95fb39-e867-4c17-9ec7-2d8175019e70")
	)
	(text "Sagitta star tracker (arcsec SGT-ARC-MAN v11.8, ch. 3)\nSupply 4.5 to 5.5 V, about 1.4 W (280 mA) imaging. arcsec requires overcurrent protection at 1 A or less.\nU12 TPS2553-1 switches +5V to J6.2. R21 43.2k sets the limit to 544 to 673 mA. On overcurrent for 7.5 ms it latches off:\nsoftware clears it by taking SGT_EN low, then high.\nSGT_EN: J5.26 -> CDH BBB P9.23 (GPIO1_17), high = on. R20 holds Sagitta off while the BBB boots.\nBefore taking SGT_EN low, disable the CDH RS-485 driver (P8.40), so it does not drive an unpowered Sagitta.\nJ6: JST BM15B-GHS-TBT. Harness = Omnetics MNPO-15-WD-18.0-N-EJS-C pigtail (mates Sagitta MNSO-15-AA-N-ETH-M),\nwires crimped 1:1 into GHR-15V-S. Pin 1 GND, 2 5V, 3 Y (TX+), 4 Z (TX-), 5 B (RX-), 6 A (RX+), 7 to 15 internal, not connected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45.72 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
